<p>
<md>dX_t
=
4\,dt
+
2\,dB_t,
\qquad
X_0=3.</md>
</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Find the distribution of <m>X_t</m> in the previous exercise.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
