</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Find the distribution of</p>

<p>
<md>\ln S_t</md>
</p>

<p>for geometric Brownian motion.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>For</p>

<p>
<md>dX_t
=
3(5-X_t)\,dt
+
2\,dB_t,</md>
</p>

