</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Write one Euler--Maruyama step for</p>

<p>
<md>dX_t
=
-X_t\,dt
+
X_t\,dB_t.</md>
</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Write one Milstein step for the same equation.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Use It\^o's formula to derive the exact solution of geometric Brownian
motion.</p>
