<p>
<md>\mathbb{E}[S_t]
=
S_0e^{\mu t}</md>
</p>

<p>for geometric Brownian motion.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Derive the variance of geometric Brownian motion.</p>
